  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP- PTIB - Partnerships for a Tolerant, Inclusive Bangladesh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project purpose is to create a community of more knowledgeable and active citizens, civil society groups, and policymakers, who with renewed understanding will remain committed to diversity, inclusion, and tolerance in Bangladesh. It aims to provide insights into the drivers of conflict, violence, and extremism and build capacity to analyze the sources and nature of disinformation, and thus to work for more  inclusivity and tolerance with a focus on youth, women, and vulnerable groups. PTIB seeks to build local research capacity, integrate the findings into project activities and input lessons learned into national, regional and global discussionson preventing violent extremism.</narrative>
  </description>
